span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:24px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">10時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:17px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:16px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">11時</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:35px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">12時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:18px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:19px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">13時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:16px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\"></span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:21px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">14時半</span></div><div class=\"fpcol\"><div class=\"fpbar\" style=\"height:27px\"></div><span class=\"fplab\">引け</span></div></div><div class=\"fplegend\">時間帯ごとの出来高（どの時間に売買が集中したか）</div><div class=\"fact\"><span>この日の値動き</span><span class=\"num\">+0.4%（値幅2.1%）</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>出来高（普段の日足平均との比）</span><span class=\"num\">0.7倍</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>終値とVWAP（1日の平均約定価格）の差</span><span class=\"num\">+0.23%</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>寄り30分／引け30分の出来高シェア</span><span class=\"num\">18% ／ 11%</span></div><div class=\"fsub\">裏にいそうな売買主体（機械推定・上位2件）</div><div class=\"discnote\">典型パターンとの一致が弱く、特定の主体色は薄い1日でした（様子見・閑散）。</div><div class=\"discnote\">リアルタイムの板（気配値・注文残）は取引所の有料データのため、場中の5分足の値動きと出来高の「形」から典型パターンとの一致度で推定しています。実際の注文主体を特定するものではありません。寄り集中＝個人の飛びつき、引け集中＋VWAP沿い＝機関の執行、出来高増なのに値幅が静か＝大口の仕込み、といった市場の経験則を採点式にしたものです。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,93.3 14.2,94.6 19.3,90.5 24.5,88.2 29.6,86.2 34.7,88.5 39.8,85.1 44.9,82.6 50.0,82.9 55.1,84.3 60.3,80.8 65.4,79.0 70.5,78.3 75.6,75.0 80.7,70.1 85.8,65.5 91.0,62.0 96.1,60.8 101.2,49.5 106.3,40.4 111.4,49.5 116.5,50.8 121.6,52.4 126.8,61.0 131.9,58.9 137.0,59.4 142.1,59.1 147.2,54.1 152.3,53.4 157.4,47.9 162.6,46.0 167.7,51.9 172.8,48.9 177.9,48.0 183.0,45.1 188.1,40.4 193.2,42.3 198.4,47.2 203.5,46.3 208.6,42.9 213.7,46.0 218.8,44.7 223.9,41.5 229.0,38.2 234.2,37.5 239.3,33.7 244.4,27.1 249.5,31.8 254.6,30.8 259.7,30.1 264.9,17.9 270.0,23.9 275.1,19.6 280.2,18.5 285.3,23.1 290.4,18.5 295.5,17.3 300.7,14.0 305.8,12.8 310.9,21.8 316.0,28.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"28.4\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,94.2 6.1,94.0 8.3,94.2 10.4,92.3 12.5,93.6 14.7,94.8 16.8,94.9 19.0,95.3 21.1,95.4 23.2,96.6 25.4,97.2 27.5,96.5 29.6,96.3 31.8,96.5 33.9,96.2 36.1,95.9 38.2,94.0 40.3,94.5 42.5,94.2 44.6,93.0 46.7,92.8 48.9,92.8 51.0,91.8 53.2,93.0 55.3,92.7 57.4,93.0 59.6,92.3 61.7,93.0 63.8,93.2 66.0,90.5 68.1,90.3 70.2,88.2 72.4,89.5 74.5,89.7 76.7,89.8 78.8,88.6 80.9,89.6 83.1,90.2 85.2,90.1 87.3,89.7 89.5,95.9 91.6,93.7 93.8,93.0 95.9,94.1 98.0,93.4 100.2,95.3 102.3,95.9 104.4,95.5 106.6,95.6 108.7,95.6 110.8,95.0 113.0,95.9 115.1,95.3 117.3,93.2 119.4,92.3 121.5,90.9 123.7,90.5 125.8,89.5 127.9,89.1 130.1,89.9 132.2,89.6 134.4,90.0 136.5,89.3 1